<%- include('../partials/site-head') %>
<%- include('../partials/site-header') %>
<main>
<section style="padding:110px 0 90px"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="label" style="margin:0 0 28px"><span class="red">&#9679;</span>&nbsp; Web development / Upkeep</p>
  <div class="split" style="grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
    <div>
      <h1 class="disp hero-h" style="font-size:clamp(44px,6.4vw,92px);margin:0 0 30px">Ecommerce website maintenance: someone looks after your site after launch.</h1>
      <p class="p" style="font-size:20px;max-width:580px;margin:0 0 38px">Updates, security, backups and changes are handled through one shared queue, with a clear monthly report on the site's health.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-red">Get a free analysis &rarr;</a></div>
    </div>
    <div style="justify-self:end;width:100%;max-width:520px"><form class="card" style="padding:40px;min-width:0" method="post" action="/contact">
  <p class="disp" style="font-size:30px;margin:0 0 10px">Get your free store analysis</p>
  <p class="p" style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 26px">See where your store is losing search traffic, on Google and in AI answers. No cost, no obligation.</p>
  <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Full name" aria-label="Full name" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D8D2C4;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;margin-bottom:12px;display:block">
  <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="Work email" aria-label="Work email" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D8D2C4;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;margin-bottom:12px;display:block">
  <input type="text" name="agency" required placeholder="Store name" aria-label="Store name" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D8D2C4;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;margin-bottom:12px;display:block">
  <input type="url" name="website" placeholder="Store website" aria-label="Store website" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D8D2C4;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;margin-bottom:12px;display:block">
  <select name="channel" aria-label="What do you want to fix first" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D8D2C4;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;margin-bottom:12px;display:block"><option>Choose one</option><option>Technical: Google can't read the store</option><option>Content: articles don't bring buyers</option><option>On-page: product pages don't rank</option><option>Links: too few trusted links</option><option>AI search: not named in AI answers</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select>
  <input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0">
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-red" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--ff-b);margin-top:8px">Get a free analysis →</button>
  <p class="label" style="margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center">Reply within one working day · No spam</p>
</form></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap split" style="gap:80px">
  <div><p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 20px">Does this sound like you?</p><h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:0">Signs it's time to work on the website.</h2></div>
  <div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">01</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Updates and security patches keep getting put off.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">02</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Small changes take days because nobody owns the site.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">03</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Plugins and apps are out of date.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">04</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">You only find out the site is down when a customer tells you.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 20px">How we work</p>
  <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:0 0 56px;max-width:820px">Review, plan, then price. In that order.</h2>
  <div class="g3"><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 01</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Plan</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We agree what is covered: updates, backups, monitoring and response times.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 02</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Queue</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Changes go into one shared list, so requests are handled in order.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 03</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Report</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">A monthly note on the site's health, what changed and what is next.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
  <div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:50px">
    <p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 18px">What changes</p>
    <p class="p" style="font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 18px">A site that stays secure, current and working, with one team to ask when something needs changing.</p>
    <a href="/web-development" class="label red">See how we work &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section data-expansion style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
<h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:860px">Ongoing care for your store</h2>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">A store needs care after launch. Platforms release updates, apps need checking, security issues come up and small changes keep arriving. When nobody owns the site, these things build up until the store breaks at the worst time.</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Our upkeep service gives you one team to ask, one queue for changes and one monthly report.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">What upkeep covers</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 26px;padding-left:22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2)"><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Platform, theme and app updates, checked on a test copy before they go live.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Security checks, and prompt action when a problem is found.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Regular backups, so you can recover quickly if something goes wrong.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Monitoring, so you hear about problems before your customers do.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Small changes and fixes, handled through a shared list.</li></ul>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">How requests work</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Send requests through one channel. We confirm each one, estimate the effort and agree the order. Urgent problems, such as a broken checkout, are handled first.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">The monthly report</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Every month you get a short report: what we checked, what changed, any issues and what's planned next. The report is written in plain language, so you can share it with your team.</p>
<h3 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.6vw,44px);margin:56px 0 24px">Frequently asked questions</h3>
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin:0 0 20px"><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Do you charge for every small change?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">Upkeep includes a set amount of small work each month. Larger changes are planned and priced separately, and we'll tell you before we start.</p></details><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Can we stop upkeep later?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">Yes. When the service ends, we hand over the documentation, the access and a summary of the store's current state.</p></details></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap">
  <div style="background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-radius:36px;padding:clamp(60px,8vw,100px) clamp(24px,5vw,60px)">
    <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,88px);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:900px">Not sure what your site needs?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 36px;color:#FBE3E0">Tell us what isn't working. On a 30-minute call we'll review the site and agree a plan before anything is priced.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background:var(--ink);color:#fff">Book a free call &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>
